                <UserObject label="" plantUmlData="{&#10;  &quot;data&quot;: &quot;@startuml GigTax_Activity_Diagram\n'=========================================\n' GigTax — Activity Diagram (End-to-End)\n'=========================================\n\nskinparam shadowing false\nskinparam backgroundColor White\nskinparam activity {\n    BackgroundColor White\n    BorderColor Black\n    ArrowColor Black\n    DiamondBackgroundColor White\n    DiamondBorderColor Black\n    FontName Arial\n    FontSize 11\n}\nskinparam defaultFontName Arial\n\n' Define swimlanes (System Left, Taxpayer Middle, External Right)\n|#E8F8E8|GigTax System|\n|#E8F0F8|Taxpayer|\n|#F0E8F8|External Services|\n\n|Taxpayer|\nstart\n\n:Register / Login;\n:Manage Profile;\n:Create Custom Classification Rules;\n\nif (Financial record entry method?) then (Upload Bank Statement)\n    :Upload Bank Statement;\n    \n    |GigTax System|\n    :Parse and Extract Transactions;\n    if (Extraction successful?) then (Yes)\n    else (Partial / Failed)\n        |Taxpayer|\n        :Manually review and correct;\n        |GigTax System|\n    endif\n\nelse (Manual Entry)\n    |Taxpayer|\n    if (Record type?) then (Income)\n        :Enter Income Record;\n    else (Expense)\n        :Enter Expense Record;\n        :Link Receipts to Transactions;\n    endif\n    \n    |GigTax System|\nendif\n\n|External Services|\n:Categorize Transactions\\n(via AI Service);\n\n|Taxpayer|\n:Review Transaction Categories;\n\n|GigTax System|\n:Compute Tax Liability;\n\nfork\n    |GigTax System|\n    :Generate Self Assessment Report;\nfork again\n    |Taxpayer|\n    :Assess Filing Guidance;\nfork again\n    |Taxpayer|\n    :Query AI Tax Advisor;\n    |External Services|\n    :Provide Advisory\\n(via RAG Service);\nend fork\n\n|Taxpayer|\nstop\n\n@enduml\n&quot;,&#10;  &quot;config&quot;: null&#10;}" id="QbrPIcvsTh2gBgfTx6FD-1">
